{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"page":1,"home":8},{"slug":2,"title":3,"headTitle":4,"description":5,"cover":6,"html":7},"case-study","Case Study","Case Study * Interface Aesthetics","Since 2001, Autistici/Inventati had been hosting email accounts and websites for movements and associations. In August 2026, the United States placed it on a…","https://d2w9rnfcy7mm78.cloudfront.net/52829205/original_38caecd905aa18466f54e8a6b2183913.png?1794836855?bc=0)","\u003Ch1>Case Study\u003C/h1>\n\u003Ch2>How do we design interfaces that last?\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>Since 2001, Autistici/Inventati had been hosting email accounts and websites for movements and associations. In August 2026, the United States placed it on a sanctions list and, in September, the collective \u003Ca href=\"https://www.ilfattoquotidiano.it/2026/09/07/autistici-inventati-sanzioni-trump-chiusura-notizie/8498485/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">suspended every service\u003C/a>.\u003Cbr>\u003Cspan class=\"indent\">\u003C/span>Platforms and interfaces often depend on just a few people, on funding that runs out or, as in the case of A/I, can shut down from one day to the next. The ones that last are often the simplest, even analogue ones.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cfigure role=\"img\" aria-label=\"\" style=\"width: 50%\">\u003Cdither-dither src=\"https://images.are.?bc=0\" cross-origin style=\"aspect-ratio: 400 / 196\">\u003C/dither-dither>\u003C/figure>\n\u003Cp>In Bologna, alongside therapy, there are many activities that can help those going through a difficult time, ranging from sport to cultural programmes. In the field of mental health, these are referred to as ‘social psychiatry’ practices and are sometimes prescribed as part of a treatment programme. They are usually recommended by a professional, and each professional is familiar with only a fraction of them. Two people with the same need may be directed in very different directions, depending on the service and the person they happen to meet.\u003Cbr>\u003Cspan class=\"indent\">\u003C/span>The city has a \u003Ca href=\"https://sitmappe.comune.bologna.it/RisorseSociali/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">map of community resources\u003C/a>. Services draw on other directories or create their own, and these are almost always compiled by those providing support, not by those seeking it. \u003Ca href=\"https://pirate.care/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Pirate Care\u003C/a>, on the other hand, focuses on horizontal knowledge, what people learn from one another.\u003Cbr>\u003Cspan class=\"indent\">\u003C/span>This is the common starting point for your course project. Before planning anything, start with what already exists and the points where the system breaks down: map out who is looking for these services, who prescribes or recommends them, who is aware of them and who provides them.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>Only after tracing these relationships, decide what shape your answer should take:\u003C/p>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cem>Categories &amp; language:\u003C/em> How are activities named and grouped, and who is left out by those words?\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cem>Medium:\u003C/em> Does it work better as a paper sheet, a phone number, a dataset, an object, a webpage or something else?\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cem>Maintenance:\u003C/em> Who updates it on Monday morning?\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Cdiv class=\"graph\">\u003Csvg viewBox=\"0 0 1665.1 849.2\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Mutual aid and self-care in books, 1950 to today, with interfaces of care built from below and by institutions\">\u003Cg>\u003Cpath d=\"M1645.1,768.2H11.8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\u003C/path>\u003Ctext x=\"11.7\" y=\"786.2\" font-size=\"14\">1950\u003C/text>\u003Ctext x=\"106.39736842105262\" y=\"786.2\" font-size=\"14\">1955\u003C/t